    <div class="section">
        <h3>Build: Data Analyzer</h3>
        <p>Three traversal patterns appear in every array-based program: sum, count, and filter. You'll implement all three against a dataset.</p>
        <p>Create a class called <code>DataAnalyzer</code>. Start with this array:</p>
        <pre>int[] data = {45, 12, 89, 33, 67, 21, 94, 50, 18, 76};</pre>
