            <li><strong>Sum:</strong> compute the total of all values.</li>
            <li><strong>Count:</strong> count how many values are above 50.</li>
            <li><strong>Filter:</strong> create a new array containing only the even values. Hint: you need two traversals — one to count evens, one to fill the array.</li>
        </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h3>Pattern Recognition</h3>
        <p>Look at the loop structure for all three tasks. What's the same? What's different? Can you write a single traversal that does all three at once?</p>
